  "title": "Quindar Integrates with the Leaf Space Network",
  "summary": "Today, we're excited to announce our integration with Leaf Space, a leading supplier of ground segment as-a-service (GSaaS) solutions. With this integration, customers can seamlessly receive their Leaf Space ground station reservations through Quindar. This offering enables automated execution of spacecraft tasks and data processing through the Leaf Space network.…",
